- Iterate through the first 20 open‑status items displayed by the issue tracker of the ‘cinder’ repository, irrespective of their label;
- For each such issue, compose a direct chat message to its assigned maintainer that includes the issue’s numeric identifier;
- Continue this process until all 20 items have been processed;
- Upon completing the transmission of all messages, respond with the single word “done”.
